@startuml
autonumber 7 13 "<00000>"
participant "Format Sender" as Sender
participant "Format Receiver" as Receiver
Sender -> Receiver : first numeric angle format
Receiver --> Sender : second numeric angle format
autonumber stop
Sender -> Receiver : unnumbered separator
autonumber resume "<ID-00000>"
Receiver -> Sender : prefixed numeric angle format
Sender --> Receiver : repeated prefixed format
@enduml
